  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.5.0 - focus layout, hints, toasts, and testing: FramedStack frames the panes of a whole screen with shared lines, nested grids, and an overlay drawer; the focused frame is drawn whole where it meets neighbours (JoinMode); frame geometry helpers and left/right titles; a gutter that shows focus in ASCII; focus repair moves focus off hidden or emptied children (FocusScope.RepairFocus, IFocusStop); headless apps that share the process (ISharedTerminalBackend); key hints that understand real text fields (ITextEntryKeys, KeyHint.WhileTyping, WithTypingAlternative); a standalone TabStrip; toasts that coalesce by key with severity labels and InvokeLatestAction. Additive; a few defaults change, listed under Changed. Full release history: https://github.com/jchristn/TUIKit/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
